    <description>Default Value for Ship To Account excluding HealthCare Account.Auto Populating the Field values for Auto/Manual Renewals and Amendment.
BOPI-730: Mapped the contract start date on opp for Manual Renewals.

BOPI-526 replaced Get Record element with hardcoded Account.RecordTypeId for developer name instead
SALDEV-1181 Added the logic for Opp CloseDate for Amended Opportunities.</description>
